<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-tot-release" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents some of the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic as of Phase 3, including gear from Celestials, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a>'s belt, a neutral neck from <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>, and two <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> BoEs. <br/>
<br/>
