<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Celestial Dungeon Gear for Subtlety Rogues</span></span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not a true "best in slot" list, but more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects. <br/>
