<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Heroic Dungeon Gear for Subtlety Rogues</span></span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc. This list gives you an idea about what's available immediately when your character dings 90.<br/>
<br/>
