<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> World Drops</span></h3>As was the case in previous expansions, there are a few powerful World BoE drops that we can use to bolster ourselves. These all come at an item level of 476.<br/>
<br/>Below are the relevant ones for Rogues:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90583/don-guerreros-glorious-choker">
<img alt="Don Guerrero's Glorious Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_112.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Guerrero's Glorious Choker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
