<img alt="Dory's Pageantry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dory's Pageantry</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90585/vulajins-vicious-breastplate">
<img alt="Vulajin's Vicious Breastplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vulajin's Vicious Breastplate</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90584/perculias-peculiar-signet">
<img alt="Perculia's Peculiar Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_a1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Perculia's Peculiar Signet</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Best Reputation Items for Subtlety Rogues</span></span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Subtlety Rogue, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a>. The Klaxxi offers a good ring through a quest reward once you reach Exalted as well as a 463 weapon. Golden Lotus offers a decent neck reward as part of a quest chain as well as the best chest option prior to raids releasing. <br/>
<br/>New in Phase 3 will be the factions <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span> &amp; <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>. The iLvl of these rewards ranges from 496 down to 476. Unfortunately, they'll be relegated to transmog once Celestials arrive.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
